        "id": "zhao-basic_attack-final_verdict",
        "name": "Final Verdict (Basic Attack)",
        "description": "Hold [BASIC] to activate:\n\nAfter getting ready, Zhao starts charging up, then launches a forward slash on release, dealing massive Ice DMG.\n\nWhile charging, Zhao accumulates up to 5s of charge time. When the /bFinishing Move//b of /bBasic Attack: Final Verdict//b, /bChain Attack//b, or /bAssist Follow-Up//b hits, the stored charge time is consumed to deal additional DMG. For every 1 second of charge time, Zhao deals a percentage of Max HP as additional DMG.\n\nWhen Zhao is in any /bEther Veil//b, if she gets switched out while charging, the charge can continue. If /bFrostbite Points//b are maxed out when the skill activates, all /bFrostbite Points//b are consumed to trigger /bEther Veil: Wellspring//b and a /bQuick Assist//b. If a squadmate is then switched in via /bQuick Assist//b, Zhao automatically follows up with /bBasic Attack: Final Verdict//b and begins charging. During skill activation, Anti-Interrupt level increases, and DMG taken is reduced by 40%. While not the currently controlled character, the character is invulnerable while using this skill.",
